      "message": "Hi Greg,\n\nFixed some of the inconsistencies between the patches.\n\nThe patches for the other branches disable ANDROID_KABI_RESERVE, ANDROID_VENDOR_DATA\\* and ANDROID_OEM_DATA\\*. android-mainline does not have ANDROID_KABI_RESERVE. ANDROID_VENDOR_DATA\\* and ANDROID_OEM_DATA\\* though are present on android-mainline, so this patch disables only those. We are only adding CONFIG_ANDROID_VENDOR_OEM_DATA in this patch.\n\nThanks,\nJaskaran.",
